OL,4,BThe best European strikers this        
OL,5,Bcentury - ranked by you                
OL,6,GClassic number nines, penalty-box      
OL,7,Gpoachers, troublesome targetmen and    
OL,8,Gtireless all-rounders.                 
OL,10,FThere is no one-size fits all when it  
OL,11,Fcomes to determining great strikers,   
OL,12,Fbut they do all share a common trait - 
OL,13,Fa ruthlessness in front of goal.       
OL,15,FThis week, however, we put the power   
OL,16,Fin your hands to decide the best       
OL,17,FEuropean frontmen of the 21st century. 
OL,19,FTens of thousands of you voted on the  
OL,20,F20-man shortlist drawn up by our panel.
